          "info": {
            "name": "Add item",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shopping_list/add_item",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "This endpoint allows for adding standard or custom commercial items to the shopping list. It supports two types of item additions:\n1. **Standard Item Addition**: Using the `addItem` schema for predefined commercial item types.\n\n2. **Custom Item Addition**: Using the `addCustomItem` schema for user-defined commercial items and collections.\n\nEnsure the request body matches the structure defined in the referenced schemas for successful operation.\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Approve order",
            "type": "http"
          },
